o think about pricing is the industry has seen some price increases across the supply chain.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2022 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2022-05-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Dr. Lisa Su","x":"We are very engaged on the AI front now continuing our investments in our software stack and working with cloud guys to optimize our software stack.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2022 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2022-05-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Brett Simpson","x":"But can you share with us how we should think about AMD in the next sort of two years, three years around areas like AI training, areas like inference, particularly with the GPU portfolio, MI300, et cetera?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2022 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2022-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dr. Lisa Su","x":"That’s one of the reasons we can increase our guidance the way it is.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2022 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2022-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dr. Lisa Su","x":"…is, we have a number of growth drivers in the business, but in terms of what has allowed us to increase the full year guide from an organic standpoint, it is a strong visibility in Server, strong visibility on the console side, strong visibility just from an overall supply and demand…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2022 Q4","e":"amd","d":"2023-01-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"In January, we previewed our next-generation MI300 accelerator that will be used for large model AI applications in cloud data centers and has been selected to power the 2-plus exaflop El Capitan exascale supercomputer at Lawrence Livermore National Laboratories.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2022 Q4","e":"amd","d":"2023-01-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"We believe that AI is a huge driver of compute growth.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2023 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2023-05-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"Customer interest has increased significantly for our next-generation Instinct MI300 GPUs for both AI training and inference of large language models.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2023 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2023-05-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"…priority, and we are engaging deeply across our customer set to bring joint solutions to the market, led by our upcoming Instinct MI300 GPUs, Ryzen 7040 Series CPUs with Ryzen AI, Zynq UltraScale+ MPSoCs, LVO V70 data center inference accelerators and Versal AI adaptive data center and edge SoCs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2023 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2023-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Ross Seymore","x":"You guys have done a great job of increasing the benefits to your customers and being able to raise prices, pass along cost increases, those sorts of things.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2023 Q2","e":"amd","d":"2023-08-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"First, deliver a broad portfolio and multi-generation roadmap of leadership GPUs, CPUs, and adaptive computing solutions for AI inferencing.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2023 Q2","e":"amd","d":"2023-08-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"On the hardware side, we announced our new Instinct MI300X GPUs designed to be the world's most advanced accelerators for generative AI.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2023 Q3","e":"amd","d":"2023-10-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"Looking forward, we are executing on a multiyear Ryzen AI road map to deliver leadership compute capabilities built on top of Microsoft's Windows software ecosystem to enable the new generation of AI PCs that will fundamentally redefine the computing experience over the coming years.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2023 Q3","e":"amd","d":"2023-10-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jean Hu","x":"Operating expenses were $1.7 billion, an increase of 12% year-over-year, primarily driven by higher R&D investment to support our significant AI growth opportunity.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2023 Q4","e":"amd","d":"2024-01-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"MI300X GPUs deliver leadership generated AI performance by combining our high-performance CDNA 3 architecture with industry-leading memory bandwidth and capacity.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2023 Q4","e":"amd","d":"2024-01-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"In Cloud, we are working closely with Microsoft, Oracle, Meta and other large cloud customers on Instinct GPU deployments, powering both their internal AI workloads and external offerings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2024 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2024-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"This is an incredibly exciting time for the industry as the widespread deployment of AI is driving demand for significantly more compute across a broad range of markets.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2024 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2024-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"Under this backdrop, we are executing very well as we ramp our data center business and enable AI capabilities across our product portfolio.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2024 Q2","e":"amd","d":"2024-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"Turning to our data center AI business, we delivered our third straight quarter of record data center GPU revenue with MI300 quarterly revenue exceeding $1 billion for the first time.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2024 Q2","e":"amd","d":"2024-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"MI325X leverages the same infrastructure as MI300 and extends our generative AI performance leadership by offering twice the memory capacity and 1.3 times more peak compute performance than competitive offerings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2024 Q3","e":"amd","d":"2024-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Dr. Lisa Su","x":"Turning to our Data Center AI business, Data Center GPU revenue ramped as MI300X adoption expanded with cloud, OEM and AI customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2024 Q3","e":"amd","d":"2024-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Dr. Lisa Su","x":"To expand our AI systems capabilities, we announced a definitive agreement to acquire ZT Systems, one of the leading providers of AI infrastructure to the world's largest hyperscale computing companies.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2024 Q4","e":"amd","d":"2025-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"We successfully established our multi-billion dollar data center AI franchise.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2024 Q4","e":"amd","d":"2025-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"Turning to our data center AI business.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2024 Q4","e":"amd","d":"2025-02-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"I know that there was some commentary about whether there were pull-ins relative to tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2025 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2025-05-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"The number of EPYC-powered cloud instances activated by Forbes 2000 enterprise customers more than doubled year-over-year, including new wins with internet-native streaming, transportation, financial services, and social media companies.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2025 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2025-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"Growth accelerated for the fourth consecutive quarter year-over-year, driven by strength in our core businesses and expanding data center and AI momentum.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2025 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2025-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"Turning to our data center AI business, revenue increased by a significant double-digit percentage year-over-year, as MI325X shipments ramp to support new enterprise and cloud deployments.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2025 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2025-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"We delivered an outstanding start to the year, despite the evolving dynamics related to tariffs and the regulatory environment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2025 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2025-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"We have not seen a lot of tariff-related activity in that business.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"AMD 2025 Q2","e":"amd","d":"2025-08-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"This continued expansion is accelerating enterprise adoption of EPYC in the cloud, with deployments growing significantly from the prior quarter as we closed large wins with dozens of large aerospace, streaming, financial services, retail and energy companies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/amd-amd-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMD 2025 Q2","e":"amd","d":"2025-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"Excluding the $800 million inventory write-down related to data center AI export controls, gross margin was 54%, marking our sixth consecutive quarter of year-over-year margin expansion led by a richer product mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/amd-amd-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMD 2025 Q2","e":"amd","d":"2025-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"In particular, adoption of agentic AI is creating additional demand for general purpose compute infrastructure as customers quickly realize that each token generated by a GPU triggers multiple CPU-intensive tasks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/amd-amd-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMD 2025 Q4","e":"amd","d":"2026-02-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"Gained significant server and PC processor share, and rapidly scaled our data center AI business as Instinct and ROCm adoption increased with cloud, enterprise, and AI customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/amd-amd-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMD 2025 Q4","e":"amd","d":"2026-02-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"Hyperscalers are expanding their infrastructure to meet growing demand for cloud services and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/amd-amd-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMD 2026 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"We delivered an outstanding start to the year driven by accelerating demand for AI infrastructure across our portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/amd-amd-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMD 2026 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"In Cloud, AI was the primary driver of growth in the quarter as every major cloud provider expanded their EPYC footprint to support a broad range of AI workloads from general purpose compute and data processing to head nodes for accelerators and emerging Agentic applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/amd-amd-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMD 2026 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2026-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"And as we said in the prepared remarks, we are expecting that there could be some demand -- sort of the demand impact as a result of the memory price increases on things like the PC business in the second half of the year as well as the Gaming business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/amd-amd-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMD 2026 Q1","e":"amd","d":"2026-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"And so in that market, it's more impacted by some of the memory pricing and the component price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/amd-amd-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMD 2026 Q2","e":"amd","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Lisa Su","x":"Data center revenue more than doubled year-over-year and now represents 58% of total revenue, up from 42% a year ago, reflecting the rapidly expanding scale of our server and data center AI businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/amd-amd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AMD 2026 Q2","e":"amd","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_